      "source": "Oracle-specific implementation for the <a href=\"CallMetaDataProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.metadata\"><code>CallMetaDataProvider</code></a> interface.\nThis class is intended for internal use by the Simple JDBC classes.",
      "translation": "Oracle 专用的<a href=\"CallMetaDataProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.metadata\"><code>CallMetaDataProvider</code></a>接口实现。该类旨在供 Simple JDBC 类内部使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Types.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Types</code></a> type for columns that return ResultSets as ref cursors\nif this feature is supported.",
      "translation": "获取返回结果集为引用游标的列的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Types.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Types</code></a>类型（如果支持此功能）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Does this database support returning ResultSets as ref cursors to be retrieved with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/CallableStatement.html#getObject(int)\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>CallableStatement.getObject(int)</code></a> for the specified column?",
      "translation": "此数据库是否支持将 ResultSet 作为引用游标返回，以便使用针对指定列的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/CallableStatement.html#getObject(int)\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>CallableStatement.getObject(int)</code></a> 进行检索？",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Does this database support returning ResultSets that should be retrieved with the JDBC call:\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Statement.html#getResultSet()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Statement.getResultSet()</code></a>?",
